{"name": "Chaos Rune : Heroes", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442580/extras_big/1cb6e5038fce3b87895977ce412bca18.webp?t=1787579532\" height=\"535\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442580/extras/1cb6e5038fce3b87895977ce412bca18.avif?t=1787579532\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u00a0 <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442580/extras/3689b9400a001eb6d17493fdf8e90ed9.webp?t=1787579532\" width=\"17\"/></span>\u00a0\u00a0<strong>Welcome to the Tower of Chaos\u00a0 \u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442580/extras/3689b9400a001eb6d17493fdf8e90ed9.webp?t=1787579532\" width=\"17\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unleash the Chaos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Chaos Rune :Heroes is a lightweight roguelike game with fast-paced turn-based + real-time mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You need to survive within the time limit and complete the corresponding challenges to advance to the next round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"68\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4442580/extras/2bf3a72dab926b579cc573954ee3f8bc.avif?t=1787579532\" width=\"68\"/></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"16\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste